[Unit]
Description=Pull ClamAV scan results after the nightly scans
Documentation=file:///home/pi/Projects/Server/4-Security-Monitoring/README.md

[Timer]
# 04:20: beefy (scan at 04:05; media-language.prom from 04:07) while it is still up, before its idle watcher powers it off around 04:26. 05:40 and 06:40: fastpi and tower (scans at 05:00), the second catching a long scan. Never wakes a host.
OnCalendar=*-*-* 04:20:00
OnCalendar=*-*-* 05:40:00
OnCalendar=*-*-* 06:40:00
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
